      "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Question Posed to the Forum</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Does anyone use the Individual Villain Numbers, or the Individual Hero Numbers?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Im thinking about removing those pages, and instead modifying the 'User Lookup' page to be able to look up an individual heroe's or villains numbers, on the spot, rather than have to update the pages themselves. I am thinking that what most people are interested in is the overall numbers anyways.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Those take up the /bulk/ of the update work (and my automated method has fallen through,but i know what i need to do to fix it just have no time...)</p>",
